    A 2x2 grid of four isometric 3D puzzle scenes, untextured flat colors, no texture maps, no noise, no detail maps, pure shader-based lighting, monochrome black and white with subtle cold blue and green tones, volumetric fog, deep shadows, minimalist geometric shapes, cinematic, eerie silence, no HUD, no text, no bright colors, inspired by Inside and Limbo but fully untextured. Top-left: a tiny lone figure connecting a thin cable from a cylindrical power source to glowing green liquid in a chasm. Top-right: the figure activating a geometric wall panel to strengthen a light bridge over the liquid. Bottom-left: the figure running across a temporary bridge of light before it fades. Bottom-right: the figure looking back as the green liquid slowly rises and follows. Each panel is a separate room, clean and minimal. Wide shot, 16:9. --ar 16:9
